        ('<h2>The car fund</h2>\n<p class="small muted">Nothing is charged yet. Each "worth €1" is counted, not billed, until enough people say yes.</p>', '<h2>El fondo del coche</h2>\n<p class="small muted">Todavía no se cobra nada. Cada "vale 1 €" se cuenta, no se cobra, hasta que suficiente gente diga que sí.</p>'),
        ('<b>Real money: <span class="real">€0 / €30,000</span></b>', '<b>Dinero real: <span class="real">€0 / €30,000</span></b>'),
        ('<span>people said "worth €1+"</span>', '<span>personas dijeron "vale 1 €+"</span>'), ('<span>intended value (not money)</span>', '<span>valor declarado (no dinero)</span>'), ('<span>countries reached</span>', '<span>países alcanzados</span>'),
        ('<h2>How it works</h2>\n<p><b>1.</b> Use a tool. Free, no account, nothing to install.</p>\n<p><b>2.</b> If it was worth something, say so: €1, €3, €5, or not.</p>\n<p><b>3.</b> When enough people say yes, optional contributions open. All of it goes to one car, counted publicly above.</p>', '<h2>Cómo funciona</h2>\n<p><b>1.</b> Usa una herramienta. Gratis, sin cuenta, sin instalar nada.</p>\n<p><b>2.</b> Si te ha valido algo, dilo: 1 €, 3 €, 5 €, o no.</p>\n<p><b>3.</b> Cuando suficiente gente diga que sí, se abren las aportaciones opcionales. Todo va a un coche, contado públicamente arriba.</p>'),
        ('data-share="Free tool that prints your scrolling as a receipt. Try it:">Share</a><a class="btn sm ghost" href="about.html">Why a car?</a><a class="btn sm ghost" href="embed/">Embed a tool</a>', 'data-share="Herramienta gratis que imprime tu scroll como un ticket. Pruébala:">Compartir</a><a class="btn sm ghost" href="about.html">¿Por qué un coche?</a><a class="btn sm ghost" href="embed/">Insertar en tu web</a>'),
